ARASAAC pictograms
------------------
Prism AAC displays pictograms from the ARASAAC collection. They are retrieved at
runtime from ARASAAC's public servers, cached on the end user's device, and are
not redistributed with this software.

    Author of the pictograms: Sergio Palao
    Origin: ARASAAC (https://arasaac.org)
    Licence: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
             (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/)
    Owner: Government of Aragon (Spain)

