Dependencies
------------
Most runtime and build dependencies are MIT, Apache-2.0, ISC or BSD. The
exceptions worth naming:

  MPL-2.0      pyodide (a direct runtime dependency shipping a WASM runtime
               to the browser), @vercel/og, lightningcss, axe-core
  CC-BY-4.0    caniuse-lite — carries an attribution requirement
  LGPL-3.0+    @img/sharp-libvips (dynamically linked), and @img/sharp-wasm32
               which is Apache-2.0 AND LGPL-3.0-or-later AND MIT

